/*
	This references the Create React App ambient types provided by `react-scripts`.
	It ensures TypeScript picks up CRA-specific global declarations (JSX, asset
	module types, and other environment typings). Keep this reference unless
	replacing these ambient declarations with other `.d.ts` files.
*/
